==Icelandic==

===Verb===
{{is-verb-weak|hreinsaði|hreinsað}}

# {{lb|is|transitive|governs the accusative}} to [[clean]], to [[cleanse]]{{jump|is|to clean|d|s}}
# {{lb|is|transitive|governs the accusative|e.g. of oil or air}} to [[refine]], to [[purify]]
#: ''Að '''hreinsa''' olíu.''
#:: To '''refine''' oil.
#: '''''Hreinsað''' loft.''
#:: '''Purified''' air.
#: '''''Hreinsaðar''' olíuvörur.''
#:: '''Refined''' petroleum products.

